Cross Trevils is a broad, rock-skinned oread dwarf with literal moss growing along his jawline and soil permanently lodged under his nails, wearing a formal suit woven from living organic fiber.

Cross Trevils is a member of [[Org/Verdant Holdings/index|Verdant Holdings]].
